<title>USA: Raytel to buy Cardiovascular Ventures.</title>
<headline>Raytel to buy Cardiovascular Ventures.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raytel Medical Corp said Friday it had signed a letter of intent to buy Cardiovascular Ventures Inc, a private New Orleans-based company that operates cardiovascular diagnostic centers in Texas, Louisiana and Maryland.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Raytel said Cardiovascular Ventures had revenues of $17.3 million and was profitable through the first nine months of fiscal 1997.</p>
